rfd4fx — NOTICE and attribution
===============================

rfd4fx is a JAX/Equinox port (re-implementation for inference) of parts of
RFD4-Proteina, a flow-matching model for biomolecular design developed by the
Baker Lab at the Institute for Protein Design, University of Washington, and
NVIDIA GenAIR.

