Derived components
------------------
The following modules of rfd4fx are ports (re-implementations in JAX/Equinox
and numpy) of the corresponding RFD4-Proteina sources, preserving the native
numerical semantics (validated by tests/module_parity/ against the native
PyTorch implementation):

  src/rfd4fx/model.py            <- rfproteina/proteina.py, rfproteina/generate.py
  src/rfd4fx/flow_matching.py    <- rfproteina/flow_matching/rdn_flow_matcher.py,
                                    rfproteina/flow_matching/product_space_flow_matcher.py
  src/rfd4fx/search.py           <- rfproteina/search/beam_search.py
  src/rfd4fx/spec.py             <- rfproteina annotated-CIF featurization pipeline
                                    (rfproteina/conditions.py, rfproteina/datapipes/)
  src/rfd4fx/featurize.py        <- native torch batch featurization
  src/rfd4fx/featurize_atoms.py  <- native annotated-CIF real-atom featurization
  src/rfd4fx/types.py            <- native batch schema (rfproteina batch containers)
  src/rfd4fx/atom24.py           <- native structure export (rfproteina/utils/structure_export.py)
  src/rfd4fx/pdb_io.py           <- native structure export (rfproteina/utils/structure_export.py)
  src/rfd4fx/ligand_conditions.py <- native ligand interaction heuristics
                                    (atomworks/ml/transforms/interactions.py, as used by RFD4-Proteina)
  src/rfd4fx/nn/features.py      <- rfproteina/nn/feature_factory.py
  src/rfd4fx/nn/transformer.py   <- rfproteina/nn/local_latents_transformer.py,
                                    rfproteina/nn/modules/{pair_bias_attn, seq_transition_af3,
                                    pair_update, pair_rep_initial, attn_n_transition}
  src/rfd4fx/nn/composites.py    <- rfproteina/nn/modules/{adaptive_ln_scale, swiglu,
                                    openfold_modules/*}
  src/rfd4fx/nn/layers.py        <- rfproteina/nn/modules/norm.py, rfproteina/nn/modules/blocks.py
  src/rfd4fx/nn/noise_alignment.py <- rfproteina/nn/noise_alignment.py
  src/rfd4fx/backend.py          <- conversion glue for the native torch modules above
  src/rfd4fx/convert.py          <- conversion glue for the native torch modules above

Port-authored components (not derived from upstream source, but exposing
semantics mirroring the native behavior):
  src/rfd4fx/rfd4_input.py       (RFD4Input authoring API)
  src/rfd4fx/ccd.py              (gemmi-backed CCD access)
  src/rfd4fx/annotated_cif.py    (annotated-CIF entry glue)
  scripts/, tests/               (design scripts and the parity test-suite)

Dependencies
------------
rfd4fx depends on third-party packages (not distributed in this repository)
with their own licenses — notably atomworks, gemmi, rdkit, biotite, networkx,
jax/equinox and (optionally, for checkpoint conversion) torch and the native
rfd4-proteina package. Their terms are provided by the respective packages.
